Inspect or reconcile a restored profile without replaying old work

Usage: mxr recovery <COMMAND>

Commands:
  status         Show the restored profile's held drafts and retired intentions
  activate       Preview activation, or activate after confirming the source owner is stopped
  prepare-draft  Preview preparing a fresh draft from a held original, or confirm it
  help           Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
